     4157   on value-changed of a-n-c in frame d-goo-doc-ref do:
     4158     run proc-valchg-a-n-c in this-procedure  no-error.
     4159     return no-apply.
     4160   end.
     4161   on any-printable of br-gds in frame d-goo-doc-ref do:
     4162     run proc-any-printable-br-gds in this-procedure   no-error.
     4163     return no-apply.
     4164   end.
     4165   on backspace of br-gds in frame d-goo-doc-ref do:
