     4287       disp loc-art with frame d-goo-doc-ref.
     4288       line-rec = recid (l-goo-doc).
     4289       reposition br-gds to recid line-rec no-error.
     4290       if error-status:error then do:     run ref/gdsrepos.p (input 1,                    input g-cond,                    input g-list,                    input g-stat,                    input flt-rec,                    output g#log,                    output contin).     if g#log then do:       run full-sch.       return error.     end.   end.   apply "VALUE-changed" to br-gds in frame d-goo-doc-ref.
     4291     end.
