     4293   PROCEDURE proc-mouse-dbl-click-loc-code:
     4294   def var str-code as integer no-undo.
     4295   define variable varresult   as character         no-undo.
     4296   define variable vartype-bc  as character         no-undo.
     4297   define variable varweight   as decimal           no-undo.
